A '''Sea Walker ''' is a {{Rarity|c|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water.

== Spawning ==
A '''Sea Walker''' can be caught on the [[Hub Island]] and most other non-fishing islands. It requires {{Skl|fishing|1}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''Sea Walker''' is {{Green|800}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|18.62%|1|5.37|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
